---
import {css} from "../../styled-system/css";
import MeetButton from "./MeetButton.astro";
---

<header class={
    css({
        maxW: '5xl',
        mx: 'auto',
        pt: '40',
        pb: '24',
        px: '6',
        textAlign: 'center'
    })}>
    <h1 class={css({
        fontFamily: 'barlow',
        fontSize: '7xl',
        fontWeight: 'semibold',
        letterSpacing: '-1',
        lineHeight: '1',
        color: 'primary.100',
        mb: '8',
        smDown: {
            fontSize: '5xl',
        }
    })}>
        VOTRE ORGANISATION ÉVOLUE, <br/>
        <span class={css({
            color: 'secondary',
            textDecoration: 'underline',
            textDecorationThickness: '4px',
            textDecorationColor: 'primary.10'
        })}>VOTRE IT AUSSI.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class={
        css({
            fontFamily: 'montserrat',
            fontSize: '2xl',
            fontWeight: 'light',
            lineHeight: '1.3',
            color: 'primary.60',
            maxW: '3xl',
            mx: 'auto',
            mb: '3rem',
        })}>
        Gardez-les alignées pour scaler sans friction. <br/>
        <span class={css({
            fontWeight: 'semibold',
            color: 'primary.100',
            textTransform: 'uppercase',
        })}>Neatcraft</span> apporte la clarté nécessaire pour bâtir
        votre croissance sur du solide.
    </p>
    <MeetButton/>
</header>
